      <guid>//localhost:1313/episodes/17-happy-death-day-03/</guid>
      <description>&lt;iframe src=&#34;https://player.rss.com/this-should-be-a-game/2930742?theme=dark&amp;v=2&#34; width=&#34;100%&#34; height=&#34;202px&#34; title=&#34;Happy Death Day (2017) - 03 - Mechanical Mailbag&#34; frameBorder=&#34;0&#34; allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture&#34; allowfullscreen scrolling=&#34;no&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://rss.com/podcasts/this-should-be-a-game/2930742/&#34;&gt;Happy Death Day (2017) - 03 - Mechanical Mailbag | RSS.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://itch.io/jam/this-should-be-a-game-jam-01&#34;&gt;The inaugural This Should Be A Game! Jam&lt;/a&gt; is open for submissions from August 3rd to September 3rd– make a game related to any of the movies we&amp;rsquo;ve covered so far on the show, or the conversations we&amp;rsquo;ve had about them!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Plus: the mechanical mailbag is open for the next double feature, as voted on by the members of our Patreon: &lt;strong&gt;John Carpenter&amp;rsquo;s Halloweenless Halloween&lt;/strong&gt;! &lt;a href=&#34;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd0CQrOA4tqSAbCEduiaiyj_y60CU3s4k_6_Q52MPmRMILXwQ/viewform&#34;&gt;Submit your ideas&lt;/a&gt; for TTRPGs and TTRPG material inspired by &lt;em&gt;In the Mouth of Madness&lt;/em&gt; or &lt;em&gt;The Thing&lt;/em&gt; and we just might discuss them on the show. The mailbag closes at 11:59 PM EST on August 27th.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
